{"2444160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Phantom", "steam_appid": 2444160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/9ca16c6f61fedc3e3878f8aef8e55fdc.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Phantom is out!<br><br>We want to thank you for your support. As a small studio, working on a beloved and historic character like the Phantom has been both an honor and a privilege. We've poured our hearts into making the Phantom look as good in the game as he does in the comics.<br><br>While the game is out now, our work on The Phantom hasn't stopped. We're hard at work and have a big patch on the way that addresses the community's feedback.<br><br>Thank you so much for being a part of this journey.  For more info on what's coming, see the discussion boards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/be2863ca86bf07c805677c31566c6def.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comics’ very first costumed hero has arrived on Steam with only his physical strength, skill with weapons and fearsome reputation to fight crime!<br><br>The Phantom is an arcade-style beat-em-up coming to PC and consoles. Play as The Phantom or his partner, Diana Palmer, in this 14-level adventure. The feared pirates of the Singh Brotherhood are battling for power and threatening The Phantom’s legacy, and it’s up to you to stop them. Use your hand-to-hand fighting skills and trusty weapons to dispatch this evil, and call in assistance from your animal friends Fraka the falcon and Devil the wolf. The Phantom features a brand-new story approved by King Features. Experience this canon addition through full-screen cut scenes and captivating in-game visuals, hand-illustrated and animated frame-by-frame by seasoned comic book artists and Art Of Play’s dedicated in-house 2D creative team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.poster.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.webm?t=1745401971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.mp4?t=1745401971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/9ca16c6f61fedc3e3878f8aef8e55fdc.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Phantom is out!<br><br>We want to thank you for your support. As a small studio, working on a beloved and historic character like the Phantom has been both an honor and a privilege. We've poured our hearts into making the Phantom look as good in the game as he does in the comics.<br><br>While the game is out now, our work on The Phantom hasn't stopped. We're hard at work and have a big patch on the way that addresses the community's feedback.<br><br>Thank you so much for being a part of this journey.  For more info on what's coming, see the discussion boards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/be2863ca86bf07c805677c31566c6def.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comics’ very first costumed hero has arrived on Steam with only his physical strength, skill with weapons and fearsome reputation to fight crime!<br><br>The Phantom is an arcade-style beat-em-up coming to PC and consoles. Play as The Phantom or his partner, Diana Palmer, in this 14-level adventure. The feared pirates of the Singh Brotherhood are battling for power and threatening The Phantom’s legacy, and it’s up to you to stop them. Use your hand-to-hand fighting skills and trusty weapons to dispatch this evil, and call in assistance from your animal friends Fraka the falcon and Devil the wolf. The Phantom features a brand-new story approved by King Features. Experience this canon addition through full-screen cut scenes and captivating in-game visuals, hand-illustrated and animated frame-by-frame by seasoned comic book artists and Art Of Play’s dedicated in-house 2D creative team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.poster.avif?t=1745401971\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.webm?t=1745401971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444160/extras/f3c2ed72d7c082db14b0ebf10afc65df.mp4?t=1745401971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The Ghost Who Walks is back! Comics' very first costumed hero is coming to Steam and console in an all new side scrolling beat-em-up adventure. Take on the Singh brotherhood across the globe with only your physical strength, skill with weapons and fearsome reputation!", "supported